        },
        {
          "doc": "Reserved. Snapshot pools were refused at deposit while the payout had\\nno path through them; they are supported now (`push_to_pool` delivers\\nthe collateral, `push_to_pool_snapshot` opens the round), so nothing\\nreturns this any more. The number stays taken so the ones below it do\\nnot shift under integrations that already read them.",
          "name": "SnapshotPoolUnsupported",
          "value": 12
